WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.584
The friends went to the park.

2
00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:13.579
Dog ran.

3
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.447
Bat flew.

4
00:00:16.448 --> 00:00:21.084
Pig, Cow, and Cat walked.

5
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:24.422
"The park will be fun," said Cow.

6
00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:27.991
"I will look for food!" said Pig.

7
00:00:27.992 --> 00:00:41.252
"And I will look for mud!"

8
00:00:41.253 --> 00:00:51.220
"There's the park!" said Dog.

9
00:00:51.221 --> 00:01:01.794
"I see new things!" said Cow.

10
00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:05.806
"Look at the lake!" said Cat.

11
00:01:05.807 --> 00:01:12.576
"Look at the ducks!" said Pig.

12
00:01:12.577 --> 00:01:17.191
"See the green frogs?" asked Bat.

13
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:20.941
"I see mud!" said Pig.

14
00:01:20.942 --> 00:01:25.189
"Ooey, gooey mud!"

15
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:29.216
Pig jumped in the mud.

16
00:01:29.217 --> 00:01:38.900
Pig rolled in the mud.

17
00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:41.953
"Come on, Pig," called Cow.

18
00:01:41.954 --> 00:01:45.214
"We want to see more things."

19
00:01:45.215 --> 00:01:47.833
Pig rolled to the left.

20
00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:52.849
Pig rolled to the right.

21
00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:58.139
But he was stuck.

22
00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:03.437
He was stuck in the mud!

